    "measurementTechnique": [
      "Direct measurements from the AQT sensor include particulate matter concentration, in units of \u03bcg/m3, at 2.5 microns (PM2.5) as well as 10 microns (PM10). Gas concentrations (CO, NO, NO2, O3) are measured in units of parts per billion (ppb).",
      "The raw data was reprocessed into daily frequency, converting the 1Hz native frequency to 1 minute averages with standard deviation as well."
    ],
